//   C: dims 'i','j' with 'i' inner  -> C(i,j) contiguous in i
//   A: dims 'i','k' with 'i' inner  -> A(i,k) contiguous in i
//   B: dims 'k','j' with 'k' inner  -> B(k,j) contiguous in k
